---
layout: base.njk
title: "Programs — ECO-BRIDGE KAWEMPE"
description: "ECO-BRIDGE KAWEMPE's 2026–2027 Work Plan: five objectives covering environmental conservation, WASH, youth livelihoods, environmental literacy, and civic engagement in Kawempe Division."
permalink: /programs/
trustbar:
  - label: "Plan period"
    value: "2026 — 2027"
  - label: "Area"
    value: "Kawempe Division, Kampala"
trustbar_link:
  href: /governance-docs/ECO-BRIDGE_KAWEMPE_WorkPlan_2026.pdf
  text: "Download full Work Plan (PDF)"
---
<section style="padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="label">2026–2027 Work Plan</span>
    <h1>Programs</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="color:var(--color-text-muted); max-width:64ch;">Five objectives, each with concrete activities, targets, and a responsible committee — drawn directly from our registered Work Plan.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% for obj in objectives %}
    <div style="margin-bottom:var(--space-2xl);">
      <h2><span class="mono" style="color:var(--color-accent)">{{ obj.number }}</span> {{ obj.heading }}</h2>
      {% if obj.intro %}<p style="color:var(--color-text-muted); max-width:60ch;">{{ obj.intro }}</p>{% endif %}
      <div class="ledger">
        {% for a in obj.activities %}
        <div class="ledger-entry" style="animation-delay:{{ loop.index0 * 40 }}ms">
          <span class="field">{{ a.activity }}</span>
          <span class="value">{{ a.detail }}</span>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="callout">
      <span class="label">Free to the community</span>
      <h3 style="margin-top:var(--space-sm); color:var(--color-text)">Every one of these services is offered free of charge</h3>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0">In line with our non-profit Constitution, school sensitisation, clean-up drives, tree planting, WASH education, and climate awareness sessions cost the community nothing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
